        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Abafilisitiya bahamagara abaherezi n’abapfumu, barababaza, bat’ Iyi sandugu y’Uhoraho tuyigenze dute? Tuyirungikane n’iki, mu ko tuyisubiza ahantu hayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
