        },
        {
          "text": "Barababaza, bati Mbega tuyihongere impongano ki? Bati Muyihongere ibisa n’ibihute bitanu mucuze mw izahabu, n’ ibisa n’imbeba bitanu mucuze mw izahabu nyene, nk’ukw igitigiri c’abaganwa b’Abafilisitiya kingana; kukw icago cabashitseko mwese ari kimwe n’icashitse ku baganwa banyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
