              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalewi bāri bawukūyekw isandugu y’Uhoraho na ka gasandugu kari kumwe na yo, karimwo vya bintu vy’izahabu, babiteretse kuri ca kibuye kinini. Nuk’ uwo musi ab’i Beti‐shemeshi bashikanira Uhoraho ibimazi vyoshejwe n’ibindi bimazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
