        {
          "text": "Ibihute vyacuzwe mw izahabu Abafilisitiya bashikaniye Uhoraho kw impongano vyar’ ibi: kimwe car’ ic’i Ashidodi, ikindi car’ ic’i Gaza, ikindi car’ ic’i Ashikeloni, ikindi car’ ic’i Gati, ikindi car’ ic’i Ekuroni; ",
