        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Uhoraho yica abantu b’i Beti‐shemeshi mirongwirindwi, kuko barungurutse mw isandugu yiwe; maz’ abantu barizwa n’uk’ Uhoraho yabiciye abantu benshi. ",
